  "title": "vl53l8cx motion detection",
  "content": "<p>When using a vl53l8cx configured for motion detection, which of the fields in the motion_indicator struct can I check to see if there was motion?</p><p>I understand that the motion[32] array has measurements but I'd like to be able to poll this infrequently and check if there was an event between these polls. Something like a motion_detected flag that latches?</p><p> </p><p>Thanks!</p>",
